        <details xmi:id="_Jlh4cpiWEeqEM7mFKilpXw" key="uuid" value="7312d779-2e44-4ae6-9ae0-656db3a02a76"/>
        <details xmi:id="_Jlh4c5iWEeqEM7mFKilpXw" key="gmm-documentation" value="&lt;div&gt;This a UML model for the Hospital Management System. This a a first version which has to be improved. Butthe main entites are given.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The hospital has several departments like Cardiology, Orthopedics, Pediatrics &amp;nbsp;etc. department.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;At reception the patient details are entered and the fees are also taken and the patient is tracked on the basis of his Id. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;A patient can visit the doctors either directly selecting a doctor or by getting admitted to the hospital and then a doctor visits the patients.&lt;/div&gt;"/>
      </eAnnotations>
    </xmi:Extension>
